{"t":"Bored Mini World Change","s":"bored-mini-world-change-7521a","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Blood_Herb_87bf9c.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Bored Mini World Change</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(8 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Mini World Change</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.40<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 14, 2011<br/>Winter Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>The witch <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyda\">Wyda</a> is bored.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snake</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworm</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Achievements\">Achievements</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Torn%20Treasures\">Torn Treasures</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Someone%27s%20Bored\">Someone's Bored</a>, Ability to obtain a <a href=\"#/wiki/Torn%20Teddy\">Torn Teddy</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Messages\">Messages</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20World%20Board\">World Board</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Sharpen your sword! The witch Wyda seems to be bored so pay her a visit!</span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Towncryer\">Towncryer</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">Hear ye! Hear ye! The witch Wyda seems to be bored. Pay her a visit but sharpen your sword. She might come up with a terrible surprise, are you brave enough to believe your eyes?</span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p>Visit <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyda\">Wyda</a> in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a>. When <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyda\">Wyda</a> is bored she will react different to keywords. If after saying \"quest\" she tells you that she's bored, you can bring her <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Herb\">Blood Herbs</a> and you have the chance to get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Torn%20Teddy\">Torn Teddy</a> and the achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Torn%20Treasures\">Torn Treasures</a>. It's also possible to earn the achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Someone%27s%20Bored\">Someone's Bored</a> by killing one of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider%20%28Wyda%29\">fake Giant Spiders</a> which spawn around <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyda\">Wyda</a>'s house.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Statistics\">Statistics</span></h3>\n<p><b>Handing in <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Herb\"><img alt=\"Blood Herb\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blood_Herb_87bf9c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Herb\">Blood Herbs</a>, 390 trials.</b><br/><br/>\n</p>\n<table class=\"loot_list sortable tw-cmd\" data-command=\"update-stats\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Item<br/></th>\n<th>Amount<br/></th>\n<th>Percentage<br/></th>\n<th>Tries to get 1<br/></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Witchesbroom\"><img alt=\"Witchesbroom\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Witchesbroom_d05680.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>Witchesbroom</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"> 376</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">96.41%</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Torn%20Teddy\"><img alt=\"Torn Teddy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Torn_Teddy_a6c362.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>Torn Teddy</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"> 14</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">3.59%</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">28</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h2>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nWyda: I'm bored! Bored bored bored! Nothing ever happens here!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>quest</b><br/>\nWyda: To be honest, I'm drowning in blood herbs by now.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>blood herb</b><br/>\nWyda: Arrr... here we go again.... do you have a #$*§# blood herb for me?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nWyda: Thank you -SOOO- much! No, I really mean it! Really! Here, let me give you a reward...<br/>(gives you a <a href=\"#/wiki/Witchesbroom\">Witchesbroom</a>)<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>blood herb</b><br/>\nWyda: Arrr... here we go again.... do you have a #$*§# blood herb for me?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nWyda: Thank you -SOOO- much! No, I really mean it! Really! Ah, you know what, you can have this old thing...<br/>(gives you a <a href=\"#/wiki/Torn%20Teddy\">Torn Teddy</a>)<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nWyda: NO! Don't go! I need someone to entertain me!\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Bored Mini World Change</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["blood-herb-quest"]}